OL,3,ASwitzerland rejects stricter
OL,4,Ainterpretation of its neutrality
OL,5,
OL,6,FVoters in Switzerland have
OL,7,Foverwhelmingly rejected a stricter
OL,8,Finterpretation of the country's
OL,9,Ftradition of diplomatic neutrality.
OL,11,FMore than 70% of Swiss voters rejected
OL,12,Fproposals that would have prevented the
OL,13,FEuropean nation from imposing sanctions
OL,14,Fwithout UN approval, official results
OL,15,Fshowed.
OL,17,FThe move would have also prevented
OL,18,FSwitzerland from pursuing closer ties
OL,19,Fwith the Nato military alliance.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
